, and experiment with custom difficulty profiles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast twin-stick shooting and responsive movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dense bullet-hell encounters and enormous enemy swarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three complete campaigns with unique progression systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide selection of score-driven arcade modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship upgrades, weapons, abilities, paints, and unlockable rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally changing arenas and encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles and ranked level mastery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard, mouse, and controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI pilot spectator battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extensive difficulty customization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every arena is a test. Every upgrade changes the fight. Every run is another chance to go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068020/extras/2c2609d66a910938883fd8fad551415f.poster.avif?t=1787931610\" width=800 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068020/extras/2c2609d66a910938883fd8fad551415f.webm?t=1787931610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068020/extras/2c2609d66a910938883fd8fad551415f.mp4?t=1787931610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "KLAST is a fast twin-stick bullet-hell roguelite where every run transforms your ship. Chain kills, rescue survivors, collect powerful upgrades, and conquer three distinct campaigns filled with shifting ar